### VietPay — Notification flows (notification-service)
### Public email endpoints are routed through Traefik at /notifications/*.
### Health, metrics, and internal endpoints are direct on port 3003
### (not exposed via Traefik).

@baseUrl = http://localhost
@directUrl = http://localhost:3003
@email = dajneem234@yopmail.com

### ── Health & metrics (direct) ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET {{directUrl}}/healthcheck

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{directUrl}}/metrics

### ── Generic email ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Send a generic email
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": ["{{email}}"],
  "subject": "Test from VietPay Notification Service",
  "html": "<h1>Hello!</h1><p>This is a test email via Nodemailer.</p>",
  "text": "Hello! This is a test email via Nodemailer."
}

### ── Welcome (new-user greeting) ───────────────────────────────────────

### Send a welcome email
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/welcome
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "{{email}}",
  "customerName": "Alice"
}

### ── Payment confirmation ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Send a debit receipt email (money sent) — "You sent X to Y"
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "{{email}}",
  "customerName": "Alice",
  "transferId": "txn_01J3K4N5P6",
  "amount": "150.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "status": "completed",
  "sourceWalletId": "wal_a1b2c3d4",
  "targetWalletId": "wal_e5f6g7h8",
  "remark": "Rent for July",
  "timestamp": "2026-07-10T08:30:00Z"
}

### Send a credit notification email (money received) — "You received X from Y"
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/transfer/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "{{email}}",
  "customerName": "Bob",
  "transferId": "txn_01J3K4N5P6",
  "amount": "150.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "status": "completed",
  "sourceWalletId": "wal_a1b2c3d4",
  "targetWalletId": "wal_e5f6g7h8",
  "remark": "Rent for July",
  "timestamp": "2026-07-10T08:30:00Z"
}

### /internal is blocked at the edge (502/418 — routed to noop, not exposed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099

### ── OTP ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Send an OTP email (login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "{{email}}",
  "customerName": "Alice",
  "otpCode": "482931",
  "purpose": "login",
  "expiresInMinutes": 5
}

### Send an OTP email (password reset)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "{{email}}",
  "customerName": "Alice",
  "otpCode": "739105",
  "purpose": "password reset",
  "expiresInMinutes": 10
}

### ── Internal: Kafka control plane (direct to port 3003) ────────────────

### List all broker topics
GET {{directUrl}}/internal/kafka/topics

### Get offsets + lag for user-events
GET {{directUrl}}/internal/kafka/topics/user-events/offsets

### Get offsets + lag for transfer-events
GET {{directUrl}}/internal/kafka/topics/transfer-events/offsets

### ── Replay: rewind to the beginning and reprocess all ───────────────

### Seek user-events partition 0 to earliest (full replay)
POST {{directUrl}}/internal/kafka/seek
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "topic": "user-events", "partition": 0, "offset": "earliest" }
  ]
}

### Seek to a specific offset (e.g. replay from offset 2 onward)
POST {{directUrl}}/internal/kafka/seek
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "topic": "user-events", "partition": 0, "offset": "2" }
  ]
}
### Seek transfer-events partition 0 to offset 0 (full replay)

POST {{directUrl}}/internal/kafka/seek
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "topic": "transfer-events", "partition": 0, "offset": "earliest" }
  ]
}

